    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enaibon naipirta olaiguanani le Turo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelotu ororei lo Laitoriani enatii naajoki: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Enkerai e tung'ani,” tiaaki ilo kitok le Turo, inji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore amu kewuasa oltau lino, nitejo iyie, Ara nanu Enkai. Aton nanu te ilo orika loo nkaitin, te mpolos oo naaiposha; nira ake sii tung'ani, nimira Enkai, hoo naa idol kewan anaa ira ng'en anaa Enkai, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neaku esipa ira iyie ng'en alang Daniel; metii entoki naisudoro te iyie; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "teng'eno ino o tening'unoto ino inotoko kewan imasaa, ninturrurruo sahabu o enkosholai apik atua arsisisho ino; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "teng'eno ino nagut e biashara itoponayie imasaa inono, netawuase oltau lino too masaa inono, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neaku inji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai: Ore amu idol kewan anaa olotiu anaa Enkai te ng'eno, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neaku, ing'ura, ekayau nanu ilomon atua iyie lelo ooitureisho oleng loo loreren, naa keshutu ninche ilalema lenye aarare esidano eng'eno ino nagut neisarkionie esikar ino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kenang'aki ninche intae engumoto niyeye intae enkeeya e lelo ooyieng'i tempolos oo naaiposha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eton ake ijo, Ara nanu Enkai! Te dukuya lelo likiyieng iyie, hoo nira tung'ani neme Enkai, tiatua inkaik e lelo likipik iyie ilbaa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iye iyie aya enkeeya e ilo lememurata te nkaina oo ltung'ani leeiking'a, ilo omoni, amu airoro nanu ejo Olaitoriani Enkai. ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Embatatata o laiguanani le Turo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake sii eewuo orerei lo Laitoriani enatii naajoki: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Enkerai e tung'ani, teyietu olkiyioi intorioki olaiguanani le Turo, nijoki ninye, Inji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai: Ira apa iyie enkitanyaanyukoto bayaroti, kibore apa eng'eno nagut, nitimitunye te nkishiaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itii apa iyie Eden, ina kurma e Nkai; ore apa pooki soit ogol enkinyang'a naa ninye intoipore, isoito ooji Karnelian o Topas o Yaspa o Krisolit o Beril, o Oniks, o Safire, o Karbunkol, o emerald; ore sahabu nasiluno naa ninche apa ininono, ninche apa isoito liguetiguete, ore teina olong apa nikintobiruaki iyie ina kata eitobiruaki sii ninche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aaitaboitaka iyie olmalaika likirrip. Itii apa iyie enchumata oldoinyio sinyati le Nkai, nishomo aimaa isoito le nkima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miata apa iyie entioto too nkoitoi inono, eiteru teina olong apa nikintobiruaki, o menoti ing'ok tiatua iyie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te nkumoi e biashara ino nikibore apa iyie olarrabal, nias iyie eng'oki; neaku aatanang'ayie iyie anaa entoki naisarkionieki aaitung'uaa oldoinyo le Nkai, ore ilo kerubi arriponi nikiaraa iyie aipungie ong'ata aitung'uaa empolos e lelo soito ooimerlel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa oltau lino naa kewuasa te nkaraki enkishiaa ino; inyala iyie eng'eno ino nagut te sikar ino. Aatanang'aka iyie enkop; aataboloyie iyie te dukuya ilaiguanak meitaraposho nkonyek enye te iyie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te nkumoi oo ing'ok inyi, teina nemetii esipata biashara inyi nisarkionie iwuejitin inono sinyat, neaku ayaua atua iyie enkima aitung'uaa erishata ino; nikinya ninye iyie amut, naaibelekeny iyie aitaa nkuruon tioriong enkop, te dukuya lelo pooki likitoduaa iyie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore lelo pooki likiyiolo iyie too loreren neing'asia te iyie, itabaikia iyie enkiting'oto torrono, nimintoki atii intarasi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
