              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai: Ore tenaiturrur ina aji e Israel tiatua lelo oreren ooidapashakaki ninche, naibalie esinyatisho ai tiatua ninche te dukuya lelo oreren pooki, neaku kepuo aatoni te nkop enye maate ina naishoo apa osinka lai Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
